## RemoteFeeLookup.java

```java
package logistics.fee;

import java.math.BigDecimal;
import java.util.List;

/** 偏远地区附加费查询：按省份名返回附加金额（单位：元）。 */
public final class RemoteFeeLookup {

    private static final BigDecimal REMOTE_SURCHARGE = new BigDecimal("8");
    private static final BigDecimal NO_SURCHARGE = BigDecimal.ZERO;

    /** 偏远省份的简称；全称（如「新疆维吾尔自治区」）按前缀收敛到简称。 */
    private static final List<String> REMOTE_PROVINCES = List.of("新疆", "西藏");

    public BigDecimal surchargeFor(String province) {
        return isRemote(province) ? REMOTE_SURCHARGE : NO_SURCHARGE;
    }

    private static boolean isRemote(String province) {
        if (province == null) {
            return false;
        }
        String trimmed = province.trim();
        return REMOTE_PROVINCES.stream().anyMatch(trimmed::startsWith);
    }
}
```

